+## Manual recommendation versus automated SMB percentage
+
+SMB Delivery Ratio scales automated SMB calculations. [Recommended Bolus Percentage](../features/bolus-calculator.md) separately scales positive calculator recommendations. The defaults are 50% and 80% respectively; these controls are not interchangeable.
